---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head><BaseHead title="About · Tsan1024" description="About Tsan1024 — making, learning, and thinking along the way." /></head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<header class="page-heading"><h1>About</h1><p lang="en">Still building, still figuring things out.</p></header>
			<section id="about-en" class="prose about-copy" lang="en" aria-label="English introduction">
				<p class="opening">Hi, I'm Tsan1024.</p>
				<p>I'm interested in AI and software engineering, and curious about how tools change the way we work, make decisions, and create. This blog is a place for technical ideas, reading notes, everyday life, and questions I haven't yet answered.</p>
				<p>I like thinking through problems: what we're really trying to solve, how to define the problem clearly, and what possible solutions there might be. Reading, research, analysis, and practice help me keep revising my understanding. Writing helps me clarify my thinking and recognize what I haven't yet figured out.</p>
				<h2>What I write about</h2>
				<ul><li><strong>AI & engineering</strong>: models, data, system design, and production practice, as well as how AI affects organizations and the way people collaborate;</li><li><strong>Making & tools</strong>: building things that are useful and maintainable over time;</li><li><strong>Reading & life</strong>: interests beyond technology, changes, and reflections along the way.</li></ul>
				<p>If you're working through similar questions, you can find me on <a href="https://github.com/Tsan1024">GitHub</a> or subscribe via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.</p>
			</section>
			<section id="about-zh" class="prose about-copy" lang="zh-CN" aria-label="中文介绍">
				<p class="opening">你好，我是 Tsan1024。</p>
				<p>我关注 AI 与软件工程，也对工具如何改变人的工作、判断与创造方式保持好奇。这里不仅保存技术方案，也记录阅读、生活，以及那些尚未形成标准答案的问题。</p>
				<p>我喜欢琢磨问题：我们真正想解决什么，怎样把问题定义清楚，又有哪些可能的解法。阅读、研究、分析和实践，让我不断修正自己的理解。写作帮助我理清思路，也看见那些还没想明白的地方。</p>
				<h2>这里会写什么</h2>
				<ul><li><strong>AI 与工程</strong>：模型、数据、系统设计与生产实践，以及 AI 对组织与协作方式的影响；</li><li><strong>创造与工具</strong>：如何构建真正有用、能够长期维护的东西；</li><li><strong>阅读与生活</strong>：技术之外的兴趣、变化和阶段性思考。</li></ul>
				<p>如果你也在解决类似的问题，欢迎通过 <a href="https://github.com/Tsan1024">GitHub</a> 找到我，或者使用 <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a> 订阅这里的更新。</p>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.about-copy { padding: 0; }
	.about-copy:lang(en) { line-height: 1.7; }
	.about-copy:lang(zh-CN) { line-height: 1.85; }
	.about-copy + .about-copy { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
	.opening { font-size: 1.1rem; }
	.about-copy h2 { margin-top: 2.5rem; font-size: 1.25rem; }
</style>
